# v1511 B13: 'X div 0' (11) and 'X mod 0' (12) are dcc E2098 (compiler error) -- the rule must NOT duplicate them.
# Float / integer-promoted 'D / 0' (14) and 'D / 0.0' (15) fire; 'X div 2' (13) and 'D / 2' (16) must not.
!division-by-zero-literal 11
!division-by-zero-literal 12
!division-by-zero-literal 13
division-by-zero-literal 14
division-by-zero-literal 15
!division-by-zero-literal 16
